        "original_id": "3bb4e84b-499b-514c-a780-8383e2e4249b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Marvel's Jessica Jones, Marvel's The Defenders\n- People: Melissa Rosenberg, Douglas Petrie, Marco Ramirez, Liz Friedman\n- Organizations: Netflix, Marvel Comics\n- Systems: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n- Concepts: The Defenders crossover miniseries\n\nFacts:\n- Marvel's Jessica Jones is an American web television series created for Netflix by Melissa Rosenberg and based on the Marvel Comics character Jessica Jones.\n- Marvel's Jessica Jones is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Marvel's Jessica Jones is the second in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- Marvel's The Defenders is an American web television miniseries created for Netflix by Douglas Petrie and Marco Ramirez and based on the Marvel Comics characters Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron Fist.\n- Marvel's The Defenders centers on the superhero team formed by Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron Fist.\n- Liz Friedman is an American television producer and writer known for her work on Young Hercules, House, and Jessica Jones.",
